        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{7}{6x}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{11}{3x}-\\frac{5}{2x}&=\\frac{22}{6x}-\\frac{15}{6x}\\\\\\frac{11}{3x}-\\frac{5}{2x}&=\\frac{22-15}{6x}\\\\\\frac{11}{3x}-\\frac{5}{2x}&=\\frac{7}{6x}\\end{align*}$$",
